          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "C.",
          "value": "\n<ol><li dir=\"ltr\">\nExpended, first: 352 \u2153 (d.) 1 \u1e25.\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n(Added in small script:) Except the purse of Abu \u02bel-Khayr, which was returned to him\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nin its entirety. It was waraq silver. All the waraq (was returned).\n</li>\n\n<p dir=\"ltr\"></p>\n<p></p>\n\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nThe agent 200 \u00bc    TWDR, first payment 8 d.\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nIdr\u012bs first payment, 3 less \u2159 (i.e.  The (Muslim) judge 3 less \u215b (3q.) 4q.).\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nIdr\u012bs 1 d. less 1\u1e25.   Qumqum \u2153 (d.) 1 \u1e25.\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nPacker 5\u00bd q.     Two f\u016b\u1e6das 1\u215b d.\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nZa \u02bffar\u0101n 1d. less 1q.   Ab\u016b D\u0101\u02bey\u016bd 9q.\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nThe judge 2d.     TY\u02beDR 1q.\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nThe master of the bath less \u215b   \u1e24aff\u0101\u1e93 3 less \u215b\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nRi\u1e0dw\u0101n 1 d. less 1q.    Q\u0101sim 1d. less 2q\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nTur\u0101b \u00bd d    Bukhtur\u012b \u00bd d.\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nTWDR 28 less \u00bc    Idr\u012bs 2\u00bd \u00bc\u00a0\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nQumqum 3 less \u215b    Idr\u012bs 1q.\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nJudge (!) 1d. less 1q.   Zayd 1d. less 1q.\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n\u1e24\u0101kim 1d. Less 1q.    Sahl 1d. less 1q.\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nY\u016bnus 1d. 1\u00bdq.    MRQS (Marcus) 3 less \u215b\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nBHBSHYM 6d. less \u00bc (6q.)  FRH\u02beM 2 less 2q.\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nKLYDS 1d. less 1 \u1e25.   Abu \u02bel-Sar\u012b 3 less 1q. 9\u00bdq.\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nMu\u1e25ammad ibn \u02bfAbdallah 2d.\n</li>\n\n<p dir=\"ltr\"> 9\u00bdq.</p>\n<p></p>\n\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Ab\u016b \u1e24ab\u012bb 6 less \u00bc (6q.)\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0KTWN 2 less 2q.\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u1e24umayd 41 \u00bc \u215b\u00a0\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Total 354\u00bd 1q.\n</li></ol>\n",
